@startuml
!include chapter-4-style.puml
title Kiến trúc triển khai production
left to right direction

actor "Người dùng" as User
cloud "Internet" as Internet

node "VPS Ubuntu" as VPS {
  node "Nginx host\nHTTPS/TLS và reverse proxy" as HostNginx #E8EEF3

  frame "Docker Compose network" as Compose {
    node "frontend" as Frontend {
      component "Nginx static server\nReact SPA" as Static
    }
    node "backend" as Backend {
      component "Spring Boot 3.5.15\nJava 17" as App
    }
    database "mysql-db\nMySQL 8.0" as MySQL
    database "redis-cache\nRedis 7.4 + AOF" as Redis
  }

  folder "mysql_data" as MySQLVolume
  folder "redis_data" as RedisVolume
  file ".env.prod\nquyền 600" as Env
}

cloud "Cloudinary" as Cloudinary
cloud "VNPay Sandbox" as VNPay
cloud "SMTP" as SMTP

User --> Internet : HTTPS
Internet --> HostNginx : 80 / 443
HostNginx --> Static : 127.0.0.1:3000\n/
HostNginx --> App : 127.0.0.1:8080\n/api, /ws-auction,\n/readiness

App --> MySQL : mạng Compose
App --> Redis : mạng Compose
MySQL --> MySQLVolume
Redis --> RedisVolume
Env ..> App : biến môi trường
Env ..> MySQL
Env ..> Redis

App --> Cloudinary
User --> Cloudinary : upload trực tiếp
App --> VNPay
User --> VNPay : redirect
App --> SMTP

note bottom of MySQL
MySQL và Redis không publish cổng ra host.
Frontend và backend chỉ bind vào loopback VPS.
end note

note bottom of HostNginx
Cấu hình TLS cổng 443 thực tế nằm trên VPS;
nginx-proxy.conf trong repository chưa phản ánh đầy đủ.
end note
@enduml
